Total Pengiriman":{"color":"#87BCEC","display":"bar"},"Pengiriman Tepat Waktu":{"color":"#F9D45C","display":"bar"},"Vendor OTD Rate":{"color":"#227FD2","line.size":"L"}},"graph.y_axis.auto_range":false,"graph.x_axis.scale":"timeseries","graph.dimensions":["Periode Bulan"]},"database":2,"parameters":[{"type":"date/single","value":"2026-01-07","id":"695f1b78","target":["variable",["template-tag","bulan"]]}]}');
