eters","Fix invitation not being sent from /setup flow","Data picker skeleton is vertically shifted","[Search] Increase search reporting","Content translation copy uses wrong header name","[METABOT] Do not apply update-keys to ai-service request state","Cast to a Datetime doesn''t play well with Joins on the Query Editor","Labels on inputs in the new-dashboard modal are incorrectly using font-weight: 800","dashboardId must be an int - error displayed for embedded maps with more than 1000 pins","bump arrow to 17 for parquet issue","Edit visualization on visualizer cards in dashboard view mode does not save the changes","Autosizing of tables on dashboards causes number to be clipped","Query Results are Temporarily Incorrect If Multiple Filter Changes are Made","Bad header alignment in filter editing sidebar","Upgrade fetch mock to v12","Changing field visibility to \"Do not include\" while filtering preview is open crashes the page","exlucde apache commons lang3","User who created Dashboard unable to change filters after Dashboard embedded with static embedding after embedding unpublished","[pivot] Optimize pivot construction for both backend and frontend","Statics Embedded Dashboard Export Icon Overlapped with Tab Navigation Arrow","It''s possible to rename a dashboard to have more than 100 characters","Can''t select filter values in dropdown via keyboard","Input not scrolled into view when tabbing into it","Ctrl/Cmd + Enter keyboard shortcut does not work to run question that times out","Field Selection Lost when Aggregates added to Question","Command palette layout shift on open","Linked tables info can be empty even when model links tables","Error when using coalesce expression in question with joins","Query error is shown when not enough permissions to run it","Accessibility issue with Filters in Dashboard","Can''t open archived model used in question","Model is being expanded to data sources after edit/distribute","Errors in dashboard edit mode after setting a d